y":"明"}},{"title":"题作么山居十首 其七","author":"释函可","text":"粗粝可克腹，生涯实有馀。\n尽除今世事，留得古人书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46244,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题作么山居十首 其八","author":"释函可","text":"参叶聊当茗，无人自一杯。\n门前屐齿响，定是老僧来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46245,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题作么山居十首 其九","author":"释函可","text":"日午尚高眠，问人雪霁未。\n沙弥九岁馀，不识人间事。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46246,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题作么山居十首 其十","author":"释函可","text":"山巅如可上，更上一重重。\n总断樵人路，低头谢旧峰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46247,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山晓","author":"释函可","text":"山晓冷恓恓，开门雪覆溪。\n偶随麋鹿迹，不觉过桥西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46248,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山暮","author":"释函可","text":"薄暮一山风，钟声在半空。\n云多遮不见，不出此山中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46249,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"接尔珍书","author":"释函可","text":"索笑堂中客，十年塞外居。\n主人犹不忘，遥寄八行书。","collection":"明","notice":"","pr